      "writtenOn": "2020-08-04T09:41:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear Jean-Michel Trivi\n\nHi.\nI have checked another codes but many other @SystemApi functions don\u0027t indicating some privileged permission.\nActually we gave just @hide annotation for this function but modified to @SystemApi according to comment #4071 .\nWe know this function is still able to access regardless of @SystemApi annotation.\nWhat we intended is just hiding this function not to be disclosed SDK.\nSo is it fine to undo the modification as @hide by your comment ?\n\nRegards,\nSungyeon Kim",
      "parentUuid": "1a63e36f_bb44aefe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4195,
        "startChar": 4,
